@title Chosen enclosure, small box: depth error, no resonance note
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The same cabinet with a chosen 900 x 500 x 240 enclosure (synthetic numbers): the Issues list says -T1 is too deep for the door of +CAB with the source of the number, and EMC-22 is quiet because the box resonates above the limit.
open qa/fixtures/enclosure-spec-small.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text EMC check
key enter
wait 10
click_text "Run the EMC rules with the design checks"
wait 10
expect_not "resonates first"
shot emc-small-box
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text Problems
key enter
wait 10
expect "too deep"
expect "enclosure data: catalogue"
shot problems-small-box
check_layout
